{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0% Programming Knowledge. 100% Vibe Coding. What can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer App. Livesplit alternative to run natively through Steam onto Windows and Linux. Timer is based on your systems time but feel free to verify its integrity. Separate builds for Windows and Linux. Linux is not being run through a translation app like Wine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default Controls are as follows (You can change these within the settings by right click)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Timer - Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset - Down Arrow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Split - Right Arrow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo Split - Left Arrow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All settings is saved to the json. Copy this json if you need multiple split files for different categories and different games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937460?t=1761820709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937460?t=1761820709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937460/d196fb6cf3fec098b907c66f44aacc6921ac05b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761820709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937460/d196fb6cf3fec098b907c66f44aacc6921ac05b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761820709","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0% Programming Knowledge. 100% Vibe Coding. What can go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer App. Livesplit alternative to run natively through Steam onto Windows and Linux. Timer is based on your systems time but feel free to verify its integrity. Separate builds for Windows and Linux. Linux is not being run through a translation app like Wine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default Controls are as follows (You can change these within the settings by right click)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Timer - Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset - Down Arrow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skip Split - Right Arrow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo Split - Left Arrow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All settings is saved to the json. Copy this json if you need multiple split files for different categories and different games.</p>","developers":["Sam Blaxell"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937460/0d5ebe4a9d8831a6475497ea91f1713f2738e66e/header.jpg?t=1761820709","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam?<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything in the last 10 years<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Anything<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937460/1168710862/274faf74dc6725d68e8b75d99200354e81a1f0b1/1755094873/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758709390","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937460/1168710862/274faf74dc6725d68e8b75d99200354e81a1f0b1/1755094873/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758709390","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3937460/1168710862/274faf74dc6725d68e8b75d99200354e81a1f0b1/1755094873/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758709390","id":257182677,"name":"VibeSplit","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182677/cb613e49125de1d3237ea016bc5ac761f5d9554b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758709390"}],"name":"VibeSpl